KG42.register("clusters-bfe41903360c14765158881b",{"id":"46-commercial_building_transactive_control::v142-d-K002","paper":"46-commercial_building_transactive_control","label":"Central air-conditioning demand-curve generation based on price mapping","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K002","label":"Central air-conditioning demand-curve generation based on price mapping","market_meaning":"The demand-generation stage uses the price-to-cooling-setpoint mapping and building operating states to construct air, water, and electricity demand curves, and requires identification of the model coefficients used on the basis of measurement data; the existing frozen chain does not yet provide the complete transformation mathematics.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["DEM"],"process_stages":["bidding","coordination"],"scope_disposition":"unresolved","scope_explanation":"Eq. (1) in the two chains points to the same central air-conditioning air-market mapping, so its repeated expression can be identified; the mapping input is called the electricity price in the formula and the chilled-air price in the process, and the relationship between the two has not yet been closed.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"The generation of a demand curve usable for clearing is treated as an independent result, with model identification retained as its supporting activity; R002 shares only the mapping statement, and its execution and exception handling are primarily owned by other clusters.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R001","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Primarily responsible for demand-curve generation, mapping input, and model-coefficient identification."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R002","ownership":"shared","role":"support","rationale":"References the same Eq. (1) and its quantity definition to explain the mapping used in demand generation; the operating fallback conditions of that chain are not automatically imposed on bid generation."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-L01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"alternative_representation","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C008"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-E010"],"rationale":"The two constraints retain the same Eq. (1) and the same piecewise conditions, used respectively to explain demand generation and setpoint coordination; this repeated mapping is not counted as two independent rules, nor does it constitute an added time dependency from operating setpoint to bidding."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M01","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::V::coordination.price_signal","v141-c-R002::V::coordination.price_signal"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R001::V::coordination.price_signal","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g01-e09"],"rationale":"Both places reference the existing price-coordination function node; the representative selection is for display only and does not resolve the identity issue between the electricity price and the chilled-air clearing price."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M02","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-x01","v141-c-R002::x::x_T_set"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-E010"],"rationale":"Both are cooling setpoints indexed by i, j, and t in the same Eq. (1); the local roles in demand generation and coordination output and the original unit records are retained."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M03","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-p01","v141-c-R002::theta::theta_lambda_t"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-E010"],"rationale":"The same Eq. (1) defines both as electricity-price inputs at time t; this link does not equate them with the chilled-air clearing price."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M04","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-p02","v141-c-R002::theta::theta_T_set_base"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-E010"],"rationale":"The same formula defines both as the baseline cooling setpoint under normal conditions; R002 has a separate fallback use, and the original uses and records remain distinct."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M05","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-p03","v141-c-R002::theta::theta_Delta_T"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-E010","v141-b-g02-E034"],"rationale":"Both are setpoint-relaxation bounds of the same mapping and reference the same example assignment; the example values are not expanded into general parameter requirements."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M06","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-p04","v141-c-R002::theta::theta_k"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g01-e14","v141-b-g02-E034"],"rationale":"Both refer to the occupant-preference parameter of the same mapping; the unspecified value, default value, and per-zone example assignment are different local records and do not overwrite one another."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M07","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-p05","v141-c-R002::theta::theta_lambda_hat_mean"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-E010"],"rationale":"The formula definitions are both the average electricity price over the preceding period; they are not identity-merged with the clearing price bearing the same symbol in the reported example."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M08","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-p06","v141-c-R002::theta::theta_sigma"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-E010"],"rationale":"Both are the historical electricity-price standard deviation in the same formula; their respective units and local bindings are retained."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-M09","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C003","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C008"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C003","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-E010"],"rationale":"The formula, piecewise conditions, and air-market applicability scope are consistent; only the demand-side expression is selected as the display representative, and both original constraints and their respective core/supporting roles are still retained."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G01","category":"upstream_missing","description":"R001 has not yet frozen complete transformation objects from setpoint to air demand, water demand, and electricity demand; relevant equations in the existing evidence cannot be directly added by D.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","v141-c-R001::V::bidding.demand"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E012","v141-b-g02-E013","v141-b-g02-E014","v141-b-g02-E015","v141-b-g02-E016","v141-b-g02-E017","v141-b-g02-E018"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"C explicitly supplements the required transformations and their bindings in Eqs. (2)–(9) according to the central-system scope, and checks dimensions, sign conventions, and applicability domains of denominators."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G02","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The process uses the chilled-air price to describe the mapping input, whereas Eq. (1) defines the input as the electricity price; the two records of the same formula cannot resolve the relationship between these two types of price.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-p01","v141-c-R002::theta::theta_lambda_t","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g01-e09","v141-b-g02-E010"],"proposal_ids":["proposal:v141-b-g02-P01"],"required_work":"Check the price conversion and commodity hierarchy and clarify the input identity; the pending mapping proposal serves only as a gap index, and no nodes or price equations are added on its basis."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G03","category":"math_incomplete","description":"The frozen applicability conditions of Eq. (1) do not exclude a zero value for the denominator standard deviation; model identification also has no explicit estimation equation. E035 simultaneously lists cross-system equations, and the regression applicability scope still needs to be separated clearly.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C003","v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-p06","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C008"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E010","v141-b-g02-E021","v141-b-g02-E035"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Supplement or clarify the treatment when the standard deviation is zero and the formula's applicability domain; clarify the central system's training equation, coefficient-identification procedure, and the system attribution of Eq. (11), without inventing a regression objective."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G04","category":"unverified_source","description":"The mapping, model, and regression evidence have not completed an independent source audit; agreement between the two Eq. (1) records does not mean that the original-text transcription has been verified.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C003","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C008"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g02-E010","v141-b-g02-E035"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Subsequently verify the original page of Eq. (1), the symbol definitions, and the model identification paragraph; keep the existing C content unchanged."}]},"rule_refs":["46-commercial_building_transactive_control::v141-c-R001","46-commercial_building_transactive_control::v141-c-R002"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-2922a59013d1b13e","COMP-98814ac540346a4b","COMP-c08cf41f234ed625"]});
